# This repo tracks only CLAUDE.md, skills/, commands/, and README.md.
# Everything else is runtime state Claude Code generates locally.
*

!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!LICENSE
!README.md
!commands/
!commands/**
!skills/
!skills/**

!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/commands/**
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**

!tmp/.gitkeep
!old/
!old/**
